        "html": "<section class=\"pp-section pp-section--sm\" style=\"padding-top: 0;\">\n      <div class=\"pp-container\">\n        <div class=\"pp-grid pp-grid--2\" style=\"gap: var(--pp-space-12); align-items: start;\">\n\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"pp-eyebrow\">Deodorizing & Disinfecting · 350 mL</span>\n            <h1 style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-2);\">Pet Deodorizing Spray</h1>\n            <p class=\"pp-lead\">Enzyme-powered daily odor control</p>\n                        <div class=\"pp-trust-row\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-6);\">\n              <span class=\"pp-badge pp-badge--amber\">MOQ 1,000</span>\n              <span class=\"pp-badge\">Sample on request</span>\n              <span class=\"pp-badge\">Quote in 1 business day</span>\n            </div>\n\n            \n            <div style=\"aspect-ratio: 1; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff, #f8fafc); border-radius: var(--pp-radius-xl); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-200); overflow: hidden;\">\n              <img src=\"/assets/img/products/pet-deodorizing-spray.png?v=2\" alt=\"Pet Deodorizing Spray\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; padding: var(--pp-space-4);\" onerror=\"this.parentElement.innerHTML='<div style=&quot;font-size: 6rem; color: var(--pp-teal-300);&quot;>🐾</div>'\">\n            </div>\n            <p style=\"font-size: var(--pp-text-xs); color: var(--pp-ink-500); margin-top: var(--pp-space-2); text-align: center;\">DEKOBIO · 350 mL</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n                        <div class=\"pp-card\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-4);\">\n\n\n              <h3 data-i18n=\"products.keyFeatures\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-2);\">Self-designed for daily pet-area deodorizing</h3>\n\n\n              <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; font-size: var(--pp-text-sm);\">\n\n\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-1);\"><strong style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-700);\">Daily-use 350 mL format</strong> &#8212; sized for ~30 days of daily pet-area application.</li>\n\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-1);\"><strong style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-700);\">Same enzyme formula as the spray-gun kit</strong> &#8212; refills compatible across both formats, mix-and-match.</li>\n\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-1);\"><strong style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-700);\">On-contact enzyme + 24&#8211;72 h probiotic</strong> &#8212; works immediately and keeps working 1&#8211;3 days on treated surfaces.</li>\n\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-700);\">Safe around cats and dogs</strong> &#8212; no synthetic fragrance, safe if pet licks treated bedding.</li>\n\n\n              </ul>\n\n\n            </div>\n\n\n            <div class=\"pp-card\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-4);\">\n\n\n              <h3 data-i18n=\"products.ingredients\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-2);\">Main ingredients &#8212; and what each one powers</h3>\n\n\n              <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: var(--pp-text-sm);\">\n\n\n                <tbody>\n\n\n                  <tr style=\" border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-100);\">\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 6px 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pp-teal-700); vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;\">Enzyme Preparations</td>\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: var(--pp-ink-700); vertical-align: top;\">On-contact decomposition &#8212; breaks down odor molecules.</td>\n\n                  <tr style=\" border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-100);\">\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 6px 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pp-teal-700); vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;\">Plant Extracts</td>\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: var(--pp-ink-700); vertical-align: top;\">No synthetic fragrance &#8212; pet-safe.</td>\n\n                  <tr style=\" border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-100);\">\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 6px 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pp-teal-700); vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;\">Odor-Eliminating Compounds</td>\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: var(--pp-ink-700); vertical-align: top;\">Lab-verified 94.2% NH&#8323; &#8212; two-gas verified.</td>\n\n                  <tr style=\" border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-100);\">\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 6px 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pp-teal-700); vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;\">Deionized Water</td>\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: var(--pp-ink-700); vertical-align: top;\">Fabric-safe &#8212; no residue on dark.</td>\n\n                  <tr style=\"\">\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 6px 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pp-teal-700); vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;\">Probiotics</td>\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: var(--pp-ink-700); vertical-align: top;\">24&#8211;72 h long-tail &#8212; sustained effect.</td>\n\n\n\n                </tbody>\n\n\n              </table>\n\n\n            </div>\n\n\n\n\n            <div class=\"pp-card\">\n\n\n              <h3 data-i18n=\"products.labReports\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-2);\">Third-party lab reports</h3>\n\n\n              <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; font-size: var(--pp-text-sm);\">\n\n\n                <li style=\"padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-100);\">\n\n                  <a href=\"/assets/img/certs/Pet-Deodorizing-Spray-Ammonia-Removal-Test.pdf\" download=\"Pet-Deodorizing-Spray-Ammonia-Removal-Test.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--pp-space-3); text-decoration: none; color: var(--pp-ink-800);\">\n\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#128196;</span>\n\n                    <span style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0;\">\n\n                      <span style=\"display: block; color: var(--pp-teal-700); font-weight: 600;\">Ammonia Removal &#183; 94.2%</span>\n\n                      <span style=\"font-size: var(--pp-text-xs); color: var(--pp-ink-500);\">789 KB &#183; PDF</span>\n\n                    </span>\n\n                    <span style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-600); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap;\">Download &#8595;</span>\n\n                  </a>\n\n                </li>\n\n                <li style=\"padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-100);\">\n\n                  <a href=\"/assets/img/certs/Pet-Deodorizing-Spray-Hydrogen-Sulfide-Removal-Test.pdf\" download=\"Pet-Deodorizing-Spray-Hydrogen-Sulfide-Removal-Test.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--pp-space-3); text-decoration: none; color: var(--pp-ink-800);\">\n\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#128196;</span>\n\n                    <span style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0;\">\n\n                      <span style=\"display: block; color: var(--pp-teal-700); font-weight: 600;\">Hydrogen Sulfide Removal &#183; 94.2%</span>\n\n                      <span style=\"font-size: var(--pp-text-xs); color: var(--pp-ink-500);\">789 KB &#183; PDF</span>\n\n                    </span>\n\n                    <span style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-600); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap;\">Download &#8595;</span>\n\n                  </a>\n\n                </li>\n\n                <li style=\"padding: 6px 0 0;\">\n\n                  <a href=\"/assets/img/certs/Pet-Deodorizing-Spray-Non-Toxic-Cert.pdf\" download=\"Pet-Deodorizing-Spray-Non-Toxic-Cert.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--pp-space-3); text-decoration: none; color: var(--pp-ink-800);\">\n\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#128196;</span>\n\n                    <span style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0;\">\n\n                      <span style=\"display: block; color: var(--pp-teal-700); font-weight: 600;\">Non-Toxic Safety Test</span>\n\n                      <span style=\"font-size: var(--pp-text-xs); color: var(--pp-ink-500);\">2.3 MB &#183; PDF</span>\n\n                    </span>\n\n                    <span style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-600); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap;\">Download &#8595;</span>\n\n                  </a>\n\n                </li>\n\n\n              </ul>\n\n\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
